   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HOLISTIC EMPOWERMENT OF WOMEN AND GIRLS IN LIKONI, MOMBASA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ray of Sunshine Foundation&#x2019;s holistic empowerment project will support vulnerable women and girls with a safe home, formal education, technical training, psychosocial support and economic empowerment. This is a follow up grant from 2022 when ROS was supported with renewable energy (Solar System) for the outreach home. Protection of vulnerable women and girls, life skills, technical training and economic empowerment.  The overall result is women&#x2019;s empowerment and contribution to gender equality for vulnerable women and girls</narrative>
  </description>
